---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { buildWebAppSchema } from '../../lib/schema';
import toolContent from '../../tools-content/troubleshooter.html?raw';

const appSchema = buildWebAppSchema({
  name: "Airbrush Troubleshooter",
  description: "Diagnose spitting, clogging and uneven spray step by step, and get the fix.",
  path: "/tools/troubleshooter/",
  free: true,
});
---
<BaseLayout title="Airbrush Troubleshooter | AirbrushDOC" description="Diagnose common airbrush problems step by step and find the fix.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(appSchema)} />
  <main class="abd-container" style="padding: 40px 24px 80px;">
    <nav class="abd-breadcrumbs" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="abd-breadcrumbs-sep">›</span>
      <a href="/tools/">Tools</a>
      <span class="abd-breadcrumbs-sep">›</span>
      <span>Airbrush Troubleshooter</span>
    </nav>
    <Fragment set:html={toolContent} />
  
    <section class="tool-about">
      <h2>How to use the airbrush troubleshooter</h2>
      <p>Pick the symptom you can actually see, spitting, spidering, bubbling in the cup, or
    nothing coming out at all, and the tool walks you through the causes in the order they are
    worth checking. It starts with the things that take seconds to rule out and only then moves on
    to stripping the airbrush down.</p>
    <p>Most faults come back to five things: paint consistency, air pressure, a dirty nozzle, a
    damaged needle, or technique. That order is deliberate. A bent needle tip is the fault people
    reach for first and it is rarely the answer; paint that is slightly too thick is the answer far
    more often.</p>
      <p class="tool-about-next"><strong>Read next:</strong> <a href="/blog/airbrush-troubleshooting-guide/">Airbrush Not Spraying Paint? Fixes by Symptom</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.tool-about {
  max-width: 68ch;
  margin: 48px auto 0;
  padding: 28px 0 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--abd-border, #2a2a2a);
}
.tool-about h2 {
  font-family: var(--abd-font-display);
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.tool-about p {
  color: var(--abd-text-dim);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
}
.tool-about-next { margin-top: 18px; }
</style>
